Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:43:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Local: Material Symbols Rounded icons in place of
 Lucide

The web build resolves app imports of lucide-react to a generated module that
overrides the icons the app uses with Material Symbols Rounded glyphs and passes
every other Lucide export through. App code keeps its Lucide imports, so upstream
changes to components do not conflict. Saved project icons and tests keep Lucide.

The spinner glyph becomes the Material 3 Expressive loading indicator: it morphs
between shapes while the app spins it.

Regenerate with t3code-customize tools/material-icons/generate.py.
